hting, motion blur, and particle-heavy VFX.\n[Shot 1] A wide, low-angle two-shot establishes <Subject 3>, the dark chaotic void arena with a glowing circular formation beneath the combatants. <Subject 1>, the Grand Elder with white hair, white beard, dark-blue gold-patterned robe, and gold-and-teal crown, stands on the left in a wide stance, his glowing golden longsword raised and trailing golden rune particles. <Subject 2>, the Blood Demon with long red hair, black-and-red battle armor, and crimson robe, stands on the right, her crimson demonic sword held low with a cold smirk at the corner of her mouth. The camera begins a fast semi-circular orbit around the pair while slowly dollying in. <Subject 1> snarls and swings his sword in a horizontal arc, summoning \"万剑归宗\": thousands of golden sword silhouettes materialize and spiral around his body, each edged with glowing runes. Simultaneously, <Subject 2> exhales a wave of crimson demonic energy that churns like a blood sea across the formation floor.\n[Shot 2] At 00:02.000, the camera continues its orbit and accelerates into a tight push-in on the two weapons as both figures lunge forward in a near-simultaneous charge. The golden longsword and the crimson demonic sword collide at the center of the frame in a violent impact, producing a sharp metallic shriek and a burst of gold-and-red sparks. The camera settles on an extreme close-up of the crossed blades, their edges vibrating with clashing energy.\n[Shot 3] At 00:04.000, the impact point erupts into a twin-colored energy storm of golden true-qi and crimson killing-qi that expands radially, shredding the surrounding sword shadows and demonic mist. The camera pulls back rapidly to a wide establishing view, capturing the shockwave rolling outward across <Subject 3> and filling the entire frame with a blinding gold-and-red detonation.\n\noverall_soundscape:\nA low, rumbling void ambience and the hiss of swirling mist continue throughout. The shot adds the whoosh of a 